Closes: https://lore.kernel.org/all/698f84c6.a70a0220.2c38d7.00cc.GAE@google.com/T/
Suggested-by: Daniel Borkmann <daniel@iogearbox.net>
Signed-off-by: Jiayuan Chen <jiayuan.chen@linux.dev>
